text = "• Move Left / Right:  A / D  or  Arrow Keys
• Charge Jump:  Hold SPACE then release
• Climb Ropes:  W / S  or  Up / Down
• Wall Slide & Jump:  Push against wall + SPACE
• Pause Game:  ESC or P"

